><ul><li>Top left: x°</li><li>Top right: 142°</li></ul></li><li>A note indicates the figure is not drawn to scale.</li></ul></div></figure></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">In the figure, line <math alttext=\"p\"><mi>p</mi>\n</math> is parallel to line <math alttext=\"q\"><mi>q</mi>\n</math>, and line <math alttext=\"t\"><mi>t</mi>\n</math> intersects both lines. What is the value of <math alttext=\"x plus 142\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>142</mn></math>?</p>","answerOptions":[{"id":"18d5ca41-c507-44af-8279-0826b058e55d","content":"<p><math alttext=\"52\"><mn>52</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"93fea47b-1403-4c03-9862-df09ff65e770","content":"<p><math alttext=\"90\"><mn>90</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"481dba43-6bfa-4099-a257-bd5efa646ea0","content":"<p><math alttext=\"142\"><mn>142</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"8af241f3-6dc0-4551-a533-76d334e1966e","content":"<p><math alttext=\"180\"><mn>180</mn>\n</math></p>"}],"keys":["8af241f3-6dc0-4551-a533-76d334e1966e"],"correct_answer":["D"],"rationale":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is correct. In the figure shown, the angle marked <math alttext=\"x degree\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&deg;</mo></math> and the angle marked <math alttext=\"142 degree\"><mn>142</mn><mo>&deg;</mo></math> form a linear pair of angles. If two angles form a linear pair of angles, the sum of the measures of the angles is <math alttext=\"180 degree\"><mn>180</mn><mo>&deg;</mo></math>. Therefore, the value of <math alttext=\"x plus 142\"><mrow>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mo>+</mo>\n<mn>142</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"180\"><mn>180</mn>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect. This is <math alttext=\"90\"><mn>90</mn>\n</math> less than <math alttext=\"142\"><mn>142</mn>\n</math>, not the sum of <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"142\"><mn>142</mn>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect. This is the measure, in degrees, of one of the angles shown.</p>","parenttemplatename":null,"parenttemplateid":null,"templateclusterid":null,"templateclustername":null,"origin":null,"position":null,"image_count":0,"raw_list":{"updateDate":1743430554981,"pPcc":"SAT#S","questionId":"3b44439b","skill_cd":"S.B.","score_band_range_cd":2,"skill_desc":"Lines, angles, and triangles","createDate":1743430554981,"program":"SAT","primary_class_cd_desc":"Geometry and Trigonometry","ibn":"","external_id":"2e29358e-5d5c-485d-bea8-cb085eba5056","primary_class_cd":"S","uId":"f817a095-fea0-4f88-a9a3-6b6d1f3eb5b3","difficulty":"E"},"raw_detail":{"type":"mcq","stem":"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><figure class='image'><svg height=\"254.209542pt\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 236.476364 254.209542\" width=\"236.476364pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A diagram of 3 lines. Refer to long description.\">\n <defs>\n  <style type=\"text/css\">\n*{stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:round;}\n  </style>\n </defs>\n <g id=\"figure_1\">\n  <g id=\"patch_1\">\n   <path d=\"M 0 254.209542 \nL 236.476364 254.209542 \nL 236.476364 0 \nL 0 0 \nz\n\" style=\"fill:none;\"></path>\n  </g>\n  <g id=\"axes_1\">\n   <g id=\"matplotlib.axis_1\"></g>\n   <g id=\"matplotlib.axis_2\"></g>\n   <g id=\"line2d_1\">\n    <path clip-path=\"url(#p61960bc9e7)\" d=\"M 7.2 81.183976 \nL 205.9875 81.183976 \n\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-linecap:square;stroke-width:0.5;\"></path>\n   </g>\n   <g id=\"line2d_2\">\n    <path clip-path=\"url(#p61960bc9e7)\" d=\"M 7.2 146.35639 \nL 205.9875 146.35639 \n\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-linecap:square;stroke-width:0.5;\"></path>\n   </g>\n   <g id=\"line2d_3\">\n    <path clip-path=\"url(#p61960bc9e7)\" d=\"M 16.711364 22.528804 \nL 206.938636 211.528804 \n\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-linecap:square;stroke-width:0.5;\"></path>\n   </g>\n   <g i