5 41.90625 32.09375 41.90625 \nQ 28 41.90625 22.796875 37 \nQ 17.703125 32.09375 14.390625 25.09375 \nQ 11.09375 18.09375 11.09375 11.90625 \nQ 11.09375 4.203125 16.40625 4.203125 \nQ 20.5 4.203125 24.59375 7.796875 \nQ 29.703125 12.203125 33.84375 20.953125 \nQ 38 29.703125 38 35.90625 \nz\n\" id=\"STIXGeneral-Italic-113\"></path>\n    </defs>\n    <g transform=\"translate(222.711364 149.327093)scale(0.13 -0.13)\">\n     <use transform=\"translate(0 0.90625)\" xlink:href=\"#STIXGeneral-Italic-113\"></use>\n    </g>\n   </g>\n   <g id=\"text_12\">\n    <!-- $\\itt$ -->\n    <defs>\n     <path d=\"M 29.59375 42.796875 \nL 29.09375 39.59375 \nL 20.703125 39.59375 \nL 12 6.796875 \nQ 11.796875 6 11.796875 5.40625 \nQ 11.796875 3.796875 13.296875 3.796875 \nQ 14.5 3.796875 16.09375 5.34375 \nQ 17.703125 6.90625 21.40625 11.703125 \nL 22.703125 11 \nQ 18.09375 4 15.140625 1.453125 \nQ 12.203125 -1.09375 8.40625 -1.09375 \nQ 3.796875 -1.09375 3.796875 2.59375 \nQ 3.796875 3.59375 5.40625 10 \nL 13.203125 39.59375 \nL 5.703125 39.59375 \nL 5.59375 40.203125 \nQ 5.59375 42 8.90625 42.703125 \nQ 11.40625 43.296875 15.5 46.546875 \nQ 19.59375 49.796875 22.203125 53.703125 \nQ 22.796875 54.59375 23.59375 54.59375 \nQ 24.5 54.59375 24.5 53.796875 \nQ 24.5 53.296875 24.40625 53.09375 \nL 21.59375 42.796875 \nz\n\" id=\"STIXGeneral-Italic-116\"></path>\n    </defs>\n    <g transform=\"translate(16.711364 16.011562)scale(0.13 -0.13)\">\n     <use transform=\"translate(0 0.40625)\" xlink:href=\"#STIXGeneral-Italic-116\"></use>\n    </g>\n   </g>\n  </g>\n </g>\n <defs>\n  <clipPath id=\"p61960bc9e7\">\n   <rect height=\"207.9\" width=\"209.25\" x=\"7.2\" y=\"13.078804\"></rect>\n  </clipPath>\n </defs>\n</svg>\n<div role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Long description for diagram of 3 lines\" class=\"sr-only\"><ul><li>Clockwise from top left, the 3 lines are labeled t, p, and q.</li><li>Line t intersects both line p and line q.</li><li>At the intersection of line t and line q, 2 angles are labeled clockwise from top left as follows:<br><ul><li>Top left: x°</li><li>Top right: 142°</li></ul></li><li>A note indicates the figure is not drawn to scale.</li></ul></div></figure></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">In the figure, line <math alttext=\"p\"><mi>p</mi>\n</math> is parallel to line <math alttext=\"q\"><mi>q</mi>\n</math>, and line <math alttext=\"t\"><mi>t</mi>\n</math> intersects both lines. What is the value of <math alttext=\"x plus 142\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>142</mn></math>?</p>","keys":["8af241f3-6dc0-4551-a533-76d334e1966e"],"answerOptions":[{"id":"18d5ca41-c507-44af-8279-0826b058e55d","content":"<p><math alttext=\"52\"><mn>52</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"93fea47b-1403-4c03-9862-df09ff65e770","content":"<p><math alttext=\"90\"><mn>90</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"481dba43-6bfa-4099-a257-bd5efa646ea0","content":"<p><math alttext=\"142\"><mn>142</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"8af241f3-6dc0-4551-a533-76d334e1966e","content":"<p><math alttext=\"180\"><mn>180</mn>\n</math></p>"}],"rationale":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is correct. In the figure shown, the angle marked <math alttext=\"x degree\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&deg;</mo></math> and the angle marked <math alttext=\"142 degree\"><mn>142</mn><mo>&deg;</mo></math> form a linear pair of angles. If two angles form a linear pair of angles, the sum of the measures of the angles is <math alttext=\"180 degree\"><mn>180</mn><mo>&deg;</mo></math>. Therefore, the value of <math alttext=\"x plus 142\"><mrow>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mo>+</mo>\n<mn>142</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"180\"><mn>180</mn>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect. This is <math alttext=\"90\"><mn>90</mn>\n</math> less than <math alttext=\"142\"><mn>142</mn>\n</math>, not the sum of <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"142\"><mn>142</mn>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect. This is the measure, in degrees, of one of the angles shown.</p>","externalid":"2e29358e-5d5c-485d-bea8-cb085eba5056","correct_answer":["D"]},"createDate":1743430554981,"updateDate":1743430554981}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1743430554981, 1743430554981),
