t=\"207.9\" width=\"209.25\" x=\"7.2\" y=\"13.43429\"></rect>\n  </clipPath>\n </defs>\n</svg>\n<div role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Long description for diagram of 3 lines\" class=\"sr-only\"><ul><li>Clockwise from top left, the 3 lines are labeled k, m, and n.</li>\n<li>Line k intersects both line m and line n.</li>\n<li>At the intersection of line k and line n, 2 angles are labeled clockwise from top left as follows:<br>\n<ul>\n<li>Top left: x°</li>\n<li>Bottom right: 145°</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>A note indicates the figure is not drawn to scale.</li>\n</ul></div></figure></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">In the figure, line <math alttext=\"m\"><mi>m</mi>\n</math> is parallel to line <math alttext=\"n\"><mi>n</mi>\n</math>, and line <math alttext=\"k\"><mi>k</mi>\n</math> intersects both lines. Which of the following statements is true?</p>","answerOptions":[{"id":"4e3d63cb-23b3-4103-8cb1-829746a08a54","content":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The value of <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> is less than <math alttext=\"145\"><mn>145</mn>\n</math>.</p>"},{"id":"ffd77068-fbf4-42f4-bc7a-21a59cbe8f96","content":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The value of <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> is greater than <math alttext=\"145\"><mn>145</mn>\n</math>.</p>"},{"id":"b7f584a8-7c1d-448a-849d-07bd460b7376","content":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The value of <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> is equal to <math alttext=\"145\"><mn>145</mn>\n</math>.</p>"},{"id":"1663fa11-75f0-4035-be94-fcb210e0f135","content":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The value of <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> cannot be determined.</p>"}],"keys":["b7f584a8-7c1d-448a-849d-07bd460b7376"],"correct_answer":["C"],"rationale":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is correct. Vertical angles, or angles that are opposite each other when two lines intersect, are congruent. It&rsquo;s given that line <math alttext=\"k\"><mi>k</mi>\n</math> intersects line <math alttext=\"n\"><mi>n</mi>\n</math>. Based on the figure, the angle with measure <math alttext=\"x degree\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#176;</mo></math> and the angle with measure <math alttext=\"145 degree\"><mn>145</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math> are vertical angles. Therefore, the value of <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> is equal to <math alttext=\"145\"><mn>145</mn>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>","parenttemplatename":null,"parenttemplateid":null,"templateclusterid":null,"templateclustername":null,"origin":null,"position":null,"image_count":0,"raw_list":{"updateDate":1730147357408,"pPcc":"SAT#S","questionId":"43236565","skill_cd":"S.B.","score_band_range_cd":3,"skill_desc":"Lines, angles, and triangles","createDate":1730147357408,"program":"SAT","primary_class_cd_desc":"Geometry and Trigonometry","ibn":"","external_id":"af58075c-8456-4696-8179-6c1a86044478","primary_class_cd":"S","uId":"acc63daf-9879-44c0-bd64-e9c11d1ce6f0","difficulty":"E"},"raw_detail":{"answerOptions":[{"content":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The value of <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> is less than <math alttext=\"145\"><mn>145</mn>\n</math>.</p>","id":"4e3d63cb-23b3-4103-8cb1-829746a08a54"},{"content":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The value of <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> is greater than <math alttext=\"145\"><mn>145</mn>\n</math>.</p>","id":"ffd77068-fbf4-42f4-bc7a-21a59cbe8f96"},{"content":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The value of <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> is equal to <math alttext=\"145\"><mn>145</mn>\n</math>.</p>","id":"b7f584a8-7c1d-448a-849d-07bd460b7376"},{"content":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The value of <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> cannot be determined.</p>","id":"1663fa11-75f0-4035-be94-fcb210e0f135"}],"externalid":"af58075c-8456-4696-8179-6c1a86044478","keys":["b7f584a8-7c1d-448a-849d-07bd460b7376"],"rationale":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is correct. Vertical angles, or angles that are opposite each other when two lines intersect, are congruent. It&rsquo;s given that line <math alttext=\"k\"><mi>k</mi>\n</math> intersects line <math alttext=\"n\"><mi>n</mi>\n</math>. Based on the figure, the angle with measure <math alttext=\"x degree\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#176;</mo></math> and the angle with measure <math alttext=\"145 degree\"><mn>145</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math> are vertical angles. Therefore, the value of <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> is equal to <math alttext=\"145\"><mn>145</mn>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>","stem":"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><figure class='image'><svg height=\"256.342457pt\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 236.177025 256.342457\" width=\"236.177025pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A diagram of 3 lines. Refer to long description.\">\n <defs>\n  <style type=\"text/css\">\n*{stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:round;}\n  </style>\n </defs>\n <g id=\"figure_1\">\n  <g id=\"patch_1\">\n   <path d=\"M 0 256.342457 \nL 236.177025 256.342457 \nL 236.177025 0 \nL 0 0 \nz\n\" style=\"fill:none;\"></path>\n  </g>\n  <g id=\"axes_1\">\n   <g id=\"matplotlib.axis_1\"></g>\n   <g id=\"matplotlib.axis_2\"></g>\n   <g id=\"line2d_1\">\n    <path clip-path=\"url(#p07b221a5b4)\" d=\"M 7.2 74.429744 \nL 205.9875 74.429744 \n\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-linecap:square;strok